  "description": "Sunhwa lives in a city lined with luxury apartment complexes. Feeling bored as a housewife, she visits 'Hwajung Sauna' on an acquaintance's recommendation, which is said to have excellent facilities and high customer satisfaction nearby. However, the sauna, which she was told was women-only, is packed with men… Dizzying desires unfold within the confined space of a Living in a sprawling city filled with luxury apartment complexes, Seonhwa is a housewife consumed by the dull, repetitive boredom of her daily life. Seeking a fresh escape, she decides to visit \"Hwajung Sauna,\" a high-end local spa highly recommended by an acquaintance for its pristine facilities and rave reviews. However, upon stepping inside what was promised to be an exclusive women-only establishment, Seonhwa is met with a shocking reality: the steam-filled rooms are packed with men. Trapped inside the enclosed, sweltering sanctuary, the boundaries of decency quickly dissolve as intoxicating, forbidden temptations take hold. Surrounded by secret encounters and scandalous desires, Seonhwa finds herself helplessly sinking into the overwhelming heat, unable to pull away:\n\n*\"This is completely insane... but why does it feel so good...?\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
